[#:seon.task{:name "status-casts-a-keyword-to-a-symbol-during-boot"
             :kind :function
             :intent "bin/seon status during boot threw ClassCastException Keyword -> Symbol in instrument/replaced-roots, reached from mcp-runtime-observation's program-function-files entities (diagnostic data/clusters/default/logs/operator-status-20260926T103046.142.edn). Not investigated."
